# Dockerfile-specific ignore file.
#
# The build context for this Dockerfile is the PARENT directory of this repo
# (it must contain both `forge-ai/` and `agentweave/` as siblings, because the
# Dockerfile COPYs the ../agentweave editable path dependency -- see
# Dockerfile and pyproject.toml's [tool.uv.sources]).
#
# Docker/BuildKit resolves an ignore file named "<dockerfile-name>.dockerignore"
# that sits next to the Dockerfile in preference to a ".dockerignore" at the
# context root, so this file is honored automatically regardless of which
# directory is actually used as the context (local `docker compose build`,
# `skaffold build`, or CI). Patterns are still evaluated relative to the
# CONTEXT ROOT (the parent directory), not this file's location, so every
# pattern below is prefixed with "forge-ai/" or "agentweave/".
#
# That parent directory is a general dev workspace with many unrelated
# sibling repos (~2.9GB locally), so we deny everything by default and only
# allow the two subtrees actually needed for the build; this keeps context
# transfer to a couple of MB instead of gigabytes.

# 0. Deny everything, then re-include only what's needed.
*
!forge-ai
!agentweave

# --- forge-ai repo ---
forge-ai/.git
forge-ai/.github
forge-ai/**/.venv
forge-ai/**/.pytest_cache
forge-ai/**/.mypy_cache
forge-ai/**/.ruff_cache
forge-ai/**/__pycache__
forge-ai/**/*.pyc
forge-ai/**/*.egg-info
forge-ai/deploy/
forge-ai/docs/
forge-ai/tests/
forge-ai/**/tests/
forge-ai/**/*.md
!forge-ai/forge.yaml.example
forge-ai/Dockerfile
forge-ai/Dockerfile.dockerignore
forge-ai/skaffold.yaml

# forge-ui: these are locally-generated build artifacts (npm ci / npm run
# build run on the host during development). They MUST be excluded: the
# Dockerfile's `COPY forge-ai/packages/forge-ui/ .` step runs AFTER
# `RUN npm ci` in the ui-builder stage, so a stale local node_modules/dist
# on disk would silently overwrite the container's freshly-installed
# node_modules and break/skew the `npm run build` (tsc) step.
forge-ai/packages/forge-ui/node_modules
forge-ai/packages/forge-ui/dist
forge-ai/packages/forge-ui/coverage
forge-ai/packages/forge-ui/.vite
forge-ai/**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- agentweave (sibling path dependency; only its pyproject.toml + package
#     source are needed to build the venv) ---
agentweave/.git
agentweave/**/.venv
agentweave/**/.pytest_cache
agentweave/**/.mypy_cache
agentweave/**/.ruff_cache
agentweave/**/__pycache__
agentweave/**/*.pyc
agentweave/**/*.egg-info
agentweave/deploy/
agentweave/docs/
agentweave/examples/
agentweave/tests/
agentweave/**/tests/
agentweave/**/*.md
